    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Pets in Shanghai can now ride their own bus! This new pet-friendly service "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "runs",
            "ref": "v-run"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " every weekend. It has quickly "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "become popular among",
            "ref": "v-become-popular-among"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " animal lovers."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Each weekend, this bus takes pets and their owners to parks and shopping malls. The trip lasts about 100 minutes. A ticket costs 20 yuan for a person and their pet. Tickets should be booked online before riding. Pets must be under 40 cm tall and have a health record, and they must also stay on a "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "leash",
            "zh": "拴狗绳"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Inside the bus, there are soft "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "cushions",
            "ref": "v-cushion"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and free snacks for pets. Safety staff check papers and make sure all pets are doing well."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The pet bus is getting lots of attention. Videos of it have become popular online. In China, there are now over 120 million cats and dogs in cities. The pet "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "economy",
            "ref": "v-economy"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " is growing fast. People hope this new idea will help more pets ride safely and make life better for pet lovers."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
